[I] A C++ library that provides several classes to manipulate threads

[T] libthreadar is a C++ library providing a set of classes for manipulating
[T] POSIX threads, propagating exceptions from a thread back to its parent
[T] on join, plus barriers, mutexes and thread-safe FIFOs. It is used by
[T] dar.

[U] https://libthreadar.sourceforge.net/

